--phase time: exit 1; stdout lines 1; status REFUSED; --out before ['.mutate.lock'] after ['.mutate.lock']; reason: another `mutate.py` run holds /tmp/round4-gizmo-perf/real-out/.mutate.lock: it owns manifest.json, manifest.final.json and exes/ of this --out, so nothing here was read or written (not waited for)
